			<div class="content" id="post-content-1874200">
									

<p>This is a really interesting concept. I think it could use perhaps a little more fleshing out, perhaps particularly related to the beliefs or actions of those affected by the broadcast. I'm also not sure that the additional SCP-classified items at the end of the article add to the story as a whole, though I don't know if you plan on going somewhere with them! If you're planning to add full SCP articles for those items, I wouldn't include their descriptions in this one.</p>
<p>I really like the mechanic of the Anboroughs, but, like Felgraf, I think that there could be something added there to make it stronger.</p>
<p>It's an interesting start, I'm curious where you want to take it!</p>

